Z||000000||Formula 18||05-19-2000||04:54 PM||||What's up? <BR>I am 18 and have loved Fiero's sience i frist saw them when I was about 10... I have finally found one near me. It is an 88 Formula, with about $1200 in new parts Ball joints, brakes, shocks, RAM clutch). It is not a show car but it is in really good shape. I do have a few questions though. The seat reclinier doesn't work. The back of the seat just kinda flo[ back and fourth. Any ideas on how to fix it??? Or anybody know about putting in diffrent seats from 4th genration Firebirds? Thanks for any help&gt; <P>Brian ||||reg||14
